\nThank you for reopening the skeeb......T T\nI really love Pachi-san's illustrations and I've been meaning to request them for a long, long time, so I'm really happy❗️❗️\nI love everything that Pachi-san draws, but I really love the Suihani Kiratto that Pachi-san draws, so I would like to request Suihani Kiratto no Yu-chan this time!\n\nI love the cheerful and happy expression that Pachi-san draws, so I would be happy if you could draw her with such an expression plus a little devilish expression. 🫶🏻 I will leave the pose and other details to you!\n\nI've always wanted to make an acuta of one of Pachi's illustrations, so if possible, I'd like a full-body illustration, but it doesn't have to be a full-body illustration! Please use a composition that is easy for Pachi-san to draw!\nI hope you will enjoy drawing it with your favorite composition 🌈♡.\n\nNoyuchan\nSecond year junior high school student, 14 years old\n149cm(I usually lie and say I'm 151cm)\nI would appreciate it if you could look at the material for my body shape!\n\nShe is calm.\nWavy long twintail\nMarshmallow pink\nAngel blue heart\nCaked-in eye blush\n\n\nPlease consider ❗️🌈🐕\n\nhttps://drive.google.com/drive/folders/1s5-2qFQsfhYoQml1tlhZ01Lcy-oSWcPm", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@wasakiroro/works/5", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/16a4f02c/uploads/origins/012a2f18-b599-4cf7-9b9f-45125598b9ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=139b47923e395657d43b3af4f1696ec5", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/16a4f02c/uploads/origins/012a2f18-b599-4cf7-9b9f-45125598b9ed?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=139b47923e395657d43b3af4f1696ec5, https://si.imgix.net